&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Ripple, we&#39;re building a world where value moves like information does today. It&#39;s big, it&#39;s bold, and we&#39;re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&lt;/div&gt;
